    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1965290/extras/0f03974d18e7f3e6cf672b24b4494c3b.avif?t=1650702512\" /></div><br><br><i>&quot;At the origin of humanity, there were great towers, whose size reached the clouds.<br>Created by the Gods, they brought comfort and peace to the hearts of men.<br>Legend said that if a man could reach the top floor of one of these towers, he would gain infinite knowledge.<br>Out of curiosity and despair, many tried, but all perished, leaving behind sorrows and regrets.<br>Tired of these failures, Men decided, by pure anger, to destroy these vestiges of the Gods, leaving no trace for future civilizations.&quot;</i><br><br>Spellgrimage is a tactical RPG rogue lite, with gestion part. Choose your heroes, assign them skills, and set out to conquer an adventure full of mystery and danger. <br><br><strong>Features</strong><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Rogue-Lite game : each new run is unique!<br></li><li>Play with many heros with unic gameplay and skills<br></li><li>Real synergy system between heroes depending on your preferences<br></li><li>Many side quests and secret passages to discover<br></li><li>Beautiful Pixel Art and animations made by professionals artist<br></li><li>Optional Card game with solid gameplay</li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1965290/extras/0f03974d18e7f3e6cf672b24b4494c3b.avif?t=1650702512\" /></div><br><br><i>&quot;At the origin of humanity, there were great towers, whose size reached the clouds.<br>Created by the Gods, they brought comfort and peace to the hearts of men.<br>Legend said that if a man could reach the top floor of one of these towers, he would gain infinite knowledge.<br>Out of curiosity and despair, many tried, but all perished, leaving behind sorrows and regrets.<br>Tired of these failures, Men decided, by pure anger, to destroy these vestiges of the Gods, leaving no trace for future civilizations.&quot;</i><br><br>Spellgrimage is a tactical RPG rogue lite, with gestion part. Choose your heroes, assign them skills, and set out to conquer an adventure full of mystery and danger. <br><br><strong>Features</strong><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Rogue-Lite game : each new run is unique!<br></li><li>Play with many heros with unic gameplay and skills<br></li><li>Real synergy system between heroes depending on your preferences<br></li><li>Many side quests and secret passages to discover<br></li><li>Beautiful Pixel Art and animations made by professionals artist<br></li><li>Optional Card game with solid gameplay</li></ul>",
